Notebook[{Cell["使用 MSGCorep 计算能带共表示", "Title"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MagneticTB 帮助主页", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/guide/MagneticTB"]}], "Text"], Cell["要判断高对称 k 点处能带的对称性，可以计算它所属的小共表示。下面以磁空间群 164.87 为例，比较旋量基和标量 s 轨道在 Gamma、K、A 点的结果。", "Text"], Cell["这项计算需要外部程序包 MSGCorep 及其依赖 SpaceGroupIrep。安装好后，在新内核中按下面的顺序加载 MSGCorep 和 MagneticTB。MSGCorep 需要由用户手动加载：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MSGCorep`\"];\nNeeds[\"MagneticTB`\"];"], "Input"], Cell["使用同一份有序 MSGCorep 操作列表", "Section"], Cell["先用 getMSGElemFromMSGCorep 取得对称操作，再按原顺序传给 init。函数打印的原胞基矢就是这个例子所用的晶格。共表示计算要求使用这份操作列表，不能换成 msgop 给出的另一份列表。", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["corepOperations = getMSGElemFromMSGCorep[{164, 87}];"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[RowBox[{"\"Primitive Lattice Vector: \"", "", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0", ",", RowBox[{"-", "a"}], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox[RowBox[{SqrtBox["3"], " ", "a"}], "2"], ",", FractionBox["a", "2"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "c"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "Primitive Lattice Vector: "*{{0, -a, 0}, {(Sqrt[3]*a)/2, a/2, 0}, {0, 0, c}}, Editable -> False]], "Print"], Cell["双值高对称点计算", "Section"], Cell["在原点放置 {sup,sdn} 两个旋量基态，计算双值共表示。这里仅保留 onsite 项，两个态的能量同为 e1，用来说明基函数如何决定共表示。", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["init[\n  lattice -> {\n    {0, -a, 0},\n    {Sqrt[3] a/2, a/2, 0},\n    {0, 0, c}\n  },\n  lattpar -> {a -> 1, c -> 2},\n  wyckoffposition -> {{{0, 0, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}},\n  symminformation -> corepOperations,\n  basisFunctions -> {{\"sup\", \"sdn\"}}\n];\ncorepHamiltonian = symham[1];\ncorepHamiltonian // MatrixForm"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[RowBox[{"\"Generators:\"", "", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"I\"", ",", "\"T\""}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"C3+\"", ",", "\"F\""}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"C21pp\"", ",", "\"T\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "Generators:"*{{"I", "T"}, {"C3+", "F"}, {"C21pp", "T"}}, Editable -> False]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[RowBox[{"\"params:\"", "", RowBox[{"{", "e1", "}"}]}], "params:"*{e1}, Editable -> False]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[RowBox[{"(", "⁠", GridBox[{{"e1", "0"}, {"0", "e1"}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> Center], "⁠", ")"}], Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output"], Cell["用倒空间分数坐标给出 Gamma、K、A 三个点，再调用 getTBBandCorep。函数直接打印 k 点名称和结果表，返回值为 Null，不会再出现一个额外的 Out 单元：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["getTBBandCorep[\n  {164, 87}, corepHamiltonian, {e1 -> 0},\n  {{0, 0, 0}, {1/3, 1/3, 0}, {0, 0, 1/2}}\n]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData["k-name: Γ, k-point: {0, 0, 0}, little co-group: D3d"], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"bands\"", "\"energy\"", "\"degeneracy\"", "\"small corep\""}, {TemplateBox[{"-", "\"-\"", "1", "2"}, "RowWithSeparators"], "0", "2", "\"(Γ)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(Γ\\), \\(4\\)]\\)(2)\""}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, Left, Center, Left}}, AutoDelete -> False, GridBoxDividers -> {"RowsIndexed" -> {2 -> Directive[Thickness[0.4], GrayLevel[0.5]]}}, GridBoxFrame -> {"ColumnsIndexed" -> {{{1, -1}, {1, -1}} -> Thickness[0.4]}}, GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, GridBoxSpacings -> {"Columns" -> {Default, 3, 1, 1}}], "Grid"]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData["k-name: K, k-point: {1/3, 1/3, 0}, little co-group: D3"], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"bands\"", "\"energy\"", "\"degeneracy\"", "\"small corep\""}, {TemplateBox[{"-", "\"-\"", "1", "2"}, "RowWithSeparators"], "0", "2", "\"(K)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(K\\), \\(4\\)]\\)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(K\\), \\(5\\)]\\)(2)\""}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, Left, Center, Left}}, AutoDelete -> False, GridBoxDividers -> {"RowsIndexed" -> {2 -> Directive[Thickness[0.4], GrayLevel[0.5]]}}, GridBoxFrame -> {"ColumnsIndexed" -> {{{1, -1}, {1, -1}} -> Thickness[0.4]}}, GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, GridBoxSpacings -> {"Columns" -> {Default, 3, 1, 1}}], "Grid"]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData["k-name: A, k-point: {0, 0, 1/2}, little co-group: D3d"], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"bands\"", "\"energy\"", "\"degeneracy\"", "\"small corep\""}, {TemplateBox[{"-", "\"-\"", "1", "2"}, "RowWithSeparators"], "0", "2", "\"(A)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(A\\), \\(4\\)]\\)(2)\""}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, Left, Center, Left}}, AutoDelete -> False, GridBoxDividers -> {"RowsIndexed" -> {2 -> Directive[Thickness[0.4], GrayLevel[0.5]]}}, GridBoxFrame -> {"ColumnsIndexed" -> {{{1, -1}, {1, -1}} -> Thickness[0.4]}}, GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, GridBoxSpacings -> {"Columns" -> {Default, 3, 1, 1}}], "Grid"]], "Print"], Cell["表格的四列依次为能带编号、能量、简并度和小共表示。取 e1 = 0 后，两个态在三个点的能量都为零，且都是二重简并；在 Gamma、K、A 点分别属于 Γ₄(2)、K₄K₅(2)、A₄(2)。这些标签各自对应所在的 k 点。", "Text"], Cell["单值基", "Section"], Cell["再把 {sup,sdn} 换成一个标量 s 轨道。仍使用同一份有序对称操作，重新 init 并求 Hamiltonian，再计算共表示：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["init[\n  lattice -> {\n    {0, -a, 0},\n    {Sqrt[3] a/2, a/2, 0},\n    {0, 0, c}\n  },\n  lattpar -> {a -> 1, c -> 2},\n  wyckoffposition -> {{{0, 0, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}},\n  symminformation -> corepOperations,\n  basisFunctions -> {{\"s\"}}\n];\ncorepHamiltonian = symham[1];\ncorepHamiltonian // MatrixForm"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[RowBox[{"\"Generators:\"", "", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"I\"", ",", "\"T\""}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"C3+\"", ",", "\"F\""}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"C21pp\"", ",", "\"T\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "Generators:"*{{"I", "T"}, {"C3+", "F"}, {"C21pp", "T"}}, Editable -> False]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[RowBox[{"\"params:\"", "", RowBox[{"{", "e1", "}"}]}], "params:"*{e1}, Editable -> False]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[RowBox[{"(", "⁠", GridBox[{{"e1"}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> Center], "⁠", ")"}], Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output"], Cell[BoxData["getTBBandCorep[\n  {164, 87}, corepHamiltonian, {e1 -> 0},\n  {{0, 0, 0}, {1/3, 1/3, 0}, {0, 0, 1/2}}\n]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData["k-name: Γ, k-point: {0, 0, 0}, little co-group: D3d"], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"bands\"", "\"energy\"", "\"degeneracy\"", "\"small corep\""}, {"1", "0", "1", "\"(Γ)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(Γ\\), \\(1\\)]\\)(1)\""}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, Left, Center, Left}}, AutoDelete -> False, GridBoxDividers -> {"RowsIndexed" -> {2 -> Directive[Thickness[0.4], GrayLevel[0.5]]}}, GridBoxFrame -> {"ColumnsIndexed" -> {{{1, -1}, {1, -1}} -> Thickness[0.4]}}, GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, GridBoxSpacings -> {"Columns" -> {Default, 3, 1, 1}}], "Grid"]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData["k-name: K, k-point: {1/3, 1/3, 0}, little co-group: D3"], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"bands\"", "\"energy\"", "\"degeneracy\"", "\"small corep\""}, {"1", "0", "1", "\"(K)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(K\\), \\(1\\)]\\)(1)\""}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, Left, Center, Left}}, AutoDelete -> False, GridBoxDividers -> {"RowsIndexed" -> {2 -> Directive[Thickness[0.4], GrayLevel[0.5]]}}, GridBoxFrame -> {"ColumnsIndexed" -> {{{1, -1}, {1, -1}} -> Thickness[0.4]}}, GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, GridBoxSpacings -> {"Columns" -> {Default, 3, 1, 1}}], "Grid"]], "Print"], Cell[BoxData["k-name: A, k-point: {0, 0, 1/2}, little co-group: D3d"], "Print"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"bands\"", "\"energy\"", "\"degeneracy\"", "\"small corep\""}, {"1", "0", "1", "\"(A)\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(A\\), \\(1\\)]\\)(1)\""}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, Left, Center, Left}}, AutoDelete -> False, GridBoxDividers -> {"RowsIndexed" -> {2 -> Directive[Thickness[0.4], GrayLevel[0.5]]}}, GridBoxFrame -> {"ColumnsIndexed" -> {{{1, -1}, {1, -1}} -> Thickness[0.4]}}, GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, GridBoxSpacings -> {"Columns" -> {Default, 3, 1, 1}}], "Grid"]], "Print"], Cell["这时只有一条非简并能带，在三个点分别属于 Γ₁(1)、K₁(1)、A₁(1)。虽然两个例子的 onsite 能量都取零，旋量基给出双值共表示，标量 s 轨道给出单值共表示。", "Text"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["历史", "HistorySection"], Cell[TextData[{"引入版本：", Cell["2.0.0", "HistoryData", CellTags -> "New"], " | 修改版本：", Cell[" ", "HistoryData", CellTags -> "Modified"], " | 废弃版本：", Cell[" ", "HistoryData", CellTags -> "Obsolete"]}], "History"]}, Closed]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["分类", "CategorizationSection"], Cell["Tech Note", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Entity Type"], Cell["MagneticTB", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Paclet Name"], Cell["MagneticTB`", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Context"], Cell["MagneticTB/tutorial/Corepresentations", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "URI"]}, Closed]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["关键词", "KeywordsSection"], Cell["MSGCorep", "Keywords"], Cell["band corepresentation", "Keywords"], Cell["double group", "Keywords"], Cell["high-symmetry point", "Keywords"]}, Closed]]}, TaggingRules -> <|"Paclet" -> "MagneticTB"|>, WindowTitle -> "Band corepresentations with MSGCorep", StyleDefinitions -> FrontEnd`FileName[{"Wolfram"}, "TechNotePageStylesExt.nb", CharacterEncoding -> "UTF-8"]]